# route-stpetersburg.keys' race with the lights switched: the car stays on the grid, the shots
# show the race's own lights (a day race: car lights off, bike lights on), then F5
# (bind_headlights) switches every vehicle's lights on and F5 again off.
# Boot -> Arcade Mode, chapter 1 "Catch Me If You Can", event 1: street race, St Petersburg
# Palace Square, 4 laps, Ford Sierra Cosworth RS500, Silver.
# Timed like route-stpetersburg.keys and needs a fresh save as that one does (no semicolons: the parser splits on them).
30000 return          # skip the intro FMV ("Shadow" by the Prodigy)
+12000 return         # title: PRESS START -> Gamer Profiles "Welcome to PGR4!"
+8000 space           # Next -> Select Driver
+8000 d 300           # right-hand driver
+1800 space           # -> Select Nationality (United States)
+8000 space           # -> Driver customisation
+8000 space           # Continue -> "Saving content", then Main Menu
+20000 space          # Single Player -> Arcade Mode
+8000 space           # Arcade Mode -> Choose Chapter
+8000 space           # Catch Me If You Can -> Choose Event
+8000 space           # Event 1 Street Race -> car (Sierra Cosworth RS500)
+8000 space           # car -> Choose Difficulty (Silver)
+8000 space           # Silver -> loading, race starts on its own
+20000 mark loaded
+0 mark race          # deck-run.sh measures from here
+3000 mark shot race
+0 f5 300             # every vehicle's lights on
+3000 mark shot on
+0 f5 300             # and off
+3000 mark shot off
+0 f5 300             # on again for the rest
+10000 mark shot on-later
